{
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse_num": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I love the LORD, because he hath heard my voice and my supplications."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "Because he hath inclined his ear unto me, therefore will I call upon him as long as I live."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        [
          {
            "text": "+ as long…: Heb. in my days"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "The sorrows of death compassed me, and the pains of hell gat hold upon me: I found trouble and sorrow."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        [
          {
            "text": "+ gat…: Heb. found me"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "Then called I upon the name of the LORD;"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "speaker": "Unknown",
          "text": "O LORD, I beseech thee, deliver my soul."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "Gracious is the LORD, and righteous; yea, our God is merciful."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "The LORD preserveth the simple: I was brought low, and he helped me."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "Return unto thy rest, O my soul; for the LORD hath dealt bountifully with thee."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "For thou hast delivered my soul from death, mine eyes from tears, and my feet from falling."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "speaker": "Psalmist",
          "text": "I will walk before the LORD in the land of the living."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I believed, therefore have I spoken:"
        },
        {
          "type": "speech",
          "speaker": "Unknown",
          "text": "I was greatly afflicted:"
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I said in my haste,"
        },
        {
          "type": "speech",
          "speaker": "Unknown",
          "text": "All men are liars."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "What shall I render unto the LORD for all his benefits toward me?"
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I will take the cup of salvation, and call upon the name of the LORD."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I will pay my vows unto the LORD now in the presence of all his people."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 15,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "speaker": "Psalmist",
          "text": "Precious in the sight of the LORD is the death of his saints."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 16,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "O LORD, truly I am thy servant; I am thy servant, and the son of thine handmaid: thou hast loosed my bonds."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 17,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I will offer to thee the sacrifice of thanksgiving, and will call upon the name of the LORD."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 18,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "I will pay my vows unto the LORD now in the presence of all his people,"
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    },
    {
      "verse_num": 19,
      "segments": [
        {
          "type": "hymnal",
          "text": "In the courts of the LORD’s house, in the midst of thee, O Jerusalem. Praise ye the LORD."
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "references": [],
      "heading": []
    }
  ]
}
